# Lightning Axe, the "pay {5}" branch (CR 601.2b, 118.3). Bot1 empties its hand but for Axe, so it cannot discard
# (the spell cannot discard itself): on turn 1 it has a Mountain and four Mox Rubies, five mana, and {R}+{5} is six, so
# the cast is refused; on turn 3 the second Mountain makes six and it is cast, with nothing discarded. The target is
# Bot1's own Ornithopter (0/2), which 5 damage destroys: a creature of one's own is a legal target.

